**.subckt top_fc Balance_Level Vinp voutp VDDA voutn Vinn Iref VSSA
*.iopin Iref
*.iopin VDDA
*.iopin VSSA
*.ipin Vinp
*.ipin Vinn
*.ipin Balance_Level
*.iopin voutp
*.iopin voutn
x1 VDDA VSSA Vinp Vinn voutp Vb1b voutn Vb1b Vb3 Vb4 Vb5b folded_cascode
x2 VDDA VSSA voutp voutn Balance_Level Vb1b Vb4 Vb6b cmfb
* noconn Vb3b
V1 Vb3 VSSA DC 3.6 AC 0
* noconn Vb5b
* noconn Vb1b
* noconn Vb6b
x3 VDDA Vb3b Vb1b Vb5b VSSA Iref Vb6b bias_circuit
* noconn Vb4
**.ends

